      "text": "You can create roles to control access to Zscaler Admin Console settings and assign these roles to Internet & SaaS, Private Access, and Digital Experience (ZDX) administrators."
    },
    {
      "heading": "About the Administration Management Page",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Administration Management page (Administration > Role Management > Client Connector), you can:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Add a role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "View the following information for roles:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Role Name: Name of role created by the super admin.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Full Access: Settings that the role has access to configure.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "View-Only Access: Settings that the role can only view.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          16
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit a role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Delete a role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "View a role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5
